<report>
<title>Simple regression - intervals for mean Y</title>

<p>@xtitle = @{var_x:roundu}<br />
@ytitle = @{var_y:roundu}</p>

<p>Confidence interval:<br />
SE for @ytitle = @{ci_y:roundu}<br />
@{pci:round1}% confidence interval = @{fromi:roundu} to @{toi:roundu}</p>


<p><ci>Prediction interval:</ci><br />
S pred = @{s_pred:roundu}<br />
<ci>@{pcp:round1}% prediction interval = @{fromp:roundu} to @{top:roundu}</ci></p>
</report>
